 record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids February to March came in under 90% of normal in 35 of them. In 2025 the county&rsquo;s middle value ran 146% of normal in April to May and 53% in July to August. So far in 2026 it sat at 46% in February to March and 123% in June to July. Grid 19973 had its driest year in 1963 at 70% of normal.</p>"}
